+# /etc/<name> and <name>.service, which would replace a system command, package or service of that name.
+# Generated from a Kali/Debian system: every name in /usr/bin, /usr/sbin, /bin, /sbin, every systemd service
+# and every installed package, lowercased, letters/digits/hyphens only.
